(7492887, 1193346, 140305, '<td valign="top">Colours are fabulous and I love the varied aspects of flight which gives this a sense of movement and lightness. My only little nit-pik is the open expanse behind the movement rather than before it - meaning I would have cropped it closer on the left and left more open space on the right - but perhaps that was not possible with this scene. In any case, very nice!</td>', 'Colours are fabulous and I love the varied aspects of flight which gives this a sense of movement and lightness. My only little nit-pik is the open expanse behind the movement rather than before it - meaning I would have cropped it closer on the left and left more open space on the right - but perhaps that was not possible with this scene. In any case, very nice!', '2017-01-18 11:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
