(7493103, 1193230, 124815, '<td valign="top">I already marked this with 7. Certainly a well done photograph. In an "Architecture" challenge it would score better.<br/> <br/>Normally I mark each image independently of the other participating photos, for its merit and also for an interpretation of the topic,  but in this particular challenge named ART some shots showing a more independent thoughts take precedence. And yet, I marked this correctly in my opinion.</td>', 'I already marked this with 7. Certainly a well done photograph. In an "Architecture" challenge it would score better. Normally I mark each image independently of the other participating photos, for its merit and also for an interpretation of the topic,  but in this particular challenge named ART some shots showing a more independent thoughts take precedence. And yet, I marked this correctly in my opinion.', '2017-01-19 12:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
