(7493528, 1193106, 140305, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier, bumping.  In my top picks, this doorway is a work of art in itself, and now can be found within another. Beautiful!</td>', 'Voted earlier, bumping.  In my top picks, this doorway is a work of art in itself, and now can be found within another. Beautiful!', '2017-01-21 15:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7493529, 1193011, 81362, '<td valign="top">Incredible rhyming of rectangular windows and fence divisions with the straight umbrella sticks and the curved railing elements with the umbrella tops makes a strong visual setting for the rhythm of heavy rain hitting the water. Wondering why anyone (or any group) would be out walking in this wetness launches complex branching internal narrative, as happens with the best of art.</td>', 'Incredible rhyming of rectangular windows and fence divisions with the straight umbrella sticks and the curved railing elements with the umbrella tops makes a strong visual setting for the rhythm of heavy rain hitting the water. Wondering why anyone (or any group) would be out walking in this wetness launches complex branching internal narrative, as happens with the best of art.', '2017-01-21 16:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7493530, 1193073, 81362, '<td valign="top">This path, a smoothly undisturbed transition from formal symmetry toward  looming  complexity, takes our imagination for a stroll into a world rich with elements of far eastern philosophy.</td>', 'This path, a smoothly undisturbed transition from formal symmetry toward  looming  complexity, takes our imagination for a stroll into a world rich with elements of far eastern philosophy.', '2017-01-21 16:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7493531, 1193414, 81362, '<td valign="top">Disturbing, haunting, mysterious feeling, with ambiguity supporting any number of interpretations yet leaving our questions unanswered. One eye closed, mismatched earrings, skin imperfections, close up perspective - all contribute to a sense of somehow intensified reality.</td>', 'Disturbing, haunting, mysterious feeling, with ambiguity supporting any number of interpretations yet leaving our questions unanswered. One eye closed, mismatched earrings, skin imperfections, close up perspective - all contribute to a sense of somehow intensified reality.', '2017-01-21 16:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7493532, 1193467, 124815, '<td valign="top">Magnificent!<br/>The eye/mind connection is sometimes going in so many directions that the words come after a long time. At first, your images brought in my mind the Sicily coat of arms, Trinacria:<br/><a href="//static3.depositphotos.com/1004500/228/i/950/depositphotos_2286660-stock-photo-symbol-sicily.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">coat of arms</a> <br/> <br/>Your image is actually "in utero" and its beautiful formality has something of the eternal mystery of man.<br/> <br/>it was 10</td>', 'Magnificent!The eye/mind connection is sometimes going in so many directions that the words come after a long time. At first, your images brought in my mind the Sicily coat of arms, Trinacria:coat of arms  Your image is actually "in utero" and its beautiful formality has something of the eternal mystery of man. it was 10', '2017-01-21 16:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7493535, 1193157, 124815, '<td valign="top">10 for now  I am speechless<br/>A photograph like this one deserves to be accompanied by music -perhaps one of those Beethoven late string quartets where one feels that the music came from a world unknown to us that is deep inside us.<br/>Ant yet, this image has a sweetness that is not being able to be imparted otherwise than by staring at it.</td>', '10 for now  I am speechlessA photograph like this one deserves to be accompanied by music -perhaps one of those Beethoven late string quartets where one feels that the music came from a world unknown to us that is deep inside us.Ant yet, this image has a sweetness that is not being able to be imparted otherwise than by staring at it.', '2017-01-21 16:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
