(7493846, 1192992, 14476, '<td valign="top">I love it when the cows (or sheep, horses, goats, etc.) look back.  This could make a fun story, indeed.</td>', 'I love it when the cows (or sheep, horses, goats, etc.) look back.  This could make a fun story, indeed.', '2017-01-22 19:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
