(7493849, 1193709, 14476, '<td valign="top">Delightful image of this Korean park.  The monks appear to be enjoying themselves on this mountain.<br/>One thought, that flying bird seems to have been strongly outlined - perhaps in processing?  IMO it would have also looked good fading into the sky more naturally.</td>', 'Delightful image of this Korean park.  The monks appear to be enjoying themselves on this mountain.One thought, that flying bird seems to have been strongly outlined - perhaps in processing?  IMO it would have also looked good fading into the sky more naturally.', '2017-01-22 19:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
