(7493852, 1193122, 14476, '<td valign="top">On my second look through these images, I had to send this one up a notch.  Lovely colors, and nice interpretation of this scene.</td>', 'On my second look through these images, I had to send this one up a notch.  Lovely colors, and nice interpretation of this scene.', '2017-01-22 19:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
