(7493858, 1193124, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very thought provoking image especially when paired with the title.  Well done on the composition and choice of b/w and grainy at that.  I love this image and think it is one of the best for this challenge.</td>', 'Very thought provoking image especially when paired with the title.  Well done on the composition and choice of b/w and grainy at that.  I love this image and think it is one of the best for this challenge.', '2017-01-22 19:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
