(7493860, 1193057, 37719, '<td valign="top">Another image that provokes many lines of thought.  So many interpretations.  Love the composition.  Love the b/w choice.  But most of all I think your perspective is spot on!  Well done!</td>', 'Another image that provokes many lines of thought.  So many interpretations.  Love the composition.  Love the b/w choice.  But most of all I think your perspective is spot on!  Well done!', '2017-01-22 19:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
