(7493865, 1193428, 14476, '<td valign="top">Diva indeed.  You have made a fine interpretation of this flower.  Thank you for entering it.</td>', 'Diva indeed.  You have made a fine interpretation of this flower.  Thank you for entering it.', '2017-01-22 19:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
