(7494160, 1193771, 50695, '<td valign="top">We want to be together and we want to be alone.<br/>Shadows flying motionless use birds as stepping stones.<br/>But every pigeon pitches pennies into concrete lakes<br/>to make his own resounding fortune and to drown in his mistakes.<br/>The couple on the second floor doesn''t see them rise and fall.<br/>They only see the sunlight breaking on their furniture and walls.</td>', 'We want to be together and we want to be alone.Shadows flying motionless use birds as stepping stones.But every pigeon pitches pennies into concrete lakesto make his own resounding fortune and to drown in his mistakes.The couple on the second floor doesn''t see them rise and fall.They only see the sunlight breaking on their furniture and walls.', '2017-01-23 21:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
