(7494240, 1193178, 113156, '<td valign="top">Got to protect all that comfort from the real knocking on the door. You''ve shown us a fine dance here, one of comfort, worry and anger, get down and hide behind this yellow bum. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153616" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153616.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153616.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153616.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Got to protect all that comfort from the real knocking on the door. You''ve shown us a fine dance here, one of comfort, worry and anger, get down and hide behind this yellow bum. ', '2017-01-24 06:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494241, 1193629, 113156, '<td valign="top">A flowering then a fading, an entanglement and a release, out of all the photos here this one brings me to the present with a clout that knocks past the attachement of me. I die, I lose all, I suffer and so and so, it''s all there, it''s all now, and it''s all perfect as such. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153614" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153614.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153614.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153614.jpg"/></a></td>', 'A flowering then a fading, an entanglement and a release, out of all the photos here this one brings me to the present with a clout that knocks past the attachement of me. I die, I lose all, I suffer and so and so, it''s all there, it''s all now, and it''s all perfect as such. ', '2017-01-24 06:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
