(7494297, 1193350, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, seems ok, but I''m not a huge fan of the cross processing look here.</td>', 'Overall, seems ok, but I''m not a huge fan of the cross processing look here.', '2017-01-24 10:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494298, 1193127, 114225, '<td valign="top">Increasing my vote on this one. I like it a lot,</td>', 'Increasing my vote on this one. I like it a lot,', '2017-01-24 10:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494299, 1193004, 100393, '<td valign="top">For me, this doesn''t represent the sort of image I''m hoping to enjoy in this challenge. Of course there''s nothing technically wrong with the image, but it holds little interest for me. I''m one of those DPC members that likes the blur, the texture, the unusual motif and will often be pursuing the ''posthumous'' thread. You''ll know yourself that this isn''t that sort of image - for which some voters may be very pleased! I''m just not one of them.<br/> <br/>For me the ''Art'' challenges are about embracing the avant-garde garde, going beyond (or falling short of) conventional representations, this image doesn''t really do that for me; but I do like the intersecting ripples and the blue light.</td>', 'For me, this doesn''t represent the sort of image I''m hoping to enjoy in this challenge. Of course there''s nothing technically wrong with the image, but it holds little interest for me. I''m one of those DPC members that likes the blur, the texture, the unusual motif and will often be pursuing the ''posthumous'' thread. You''ll know yourself that this isn''t that sort of image - for which some voters may be very pleased! I''m just not one of them. For me the ''Art'' challenges are about embracing the avant-garde garde, going beyond (or falling short of) conventional representations, this image doesn''t really do that for me; but I do like the intersecting ripples and the blue light.', '2017-01-24 11:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494300, 1193178, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is my top pick. There''s something so evocative here and a degree of immersion too.<br/> <br/>It''s like you''ve captured a perfect life moment and put it in front of us.<br/> <br/>Perfect choice of toning and selective blur.</td>', 'This is my top pick. There''s something so evocative here and a degree of immersion too. It''s like you''ve captured a perfect life moment and put it in front of us. Perfect choice of toning and selective blur.', '2017-01-24 11:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494301, 1193188, 100393, '<td valign="top">I do like this. A lot. I''ve given it a 9. It was a 10, but I couldn''t shake the sense that this is more about the processing than the image itself - of course they complement; but I feel you have begun to lose your vision, your photography with your chosen edit.<br/> <br/>I do like the overall motif and the lighting though. A lot.</td>', 'I do like this. A lot. I''ve given it a 9. It was a 10, but I couldn''t shake the sense that this is more about the processing than the image itself - of course they complement; but I feel you have begun to lose your vision, your photography with your chosen edit. I do like the overall motif and the lighting though. A lot.', '2017-01-24 11:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494302, 1193046, 100393, '<td valign="top">Magnificent feet, magnificent flair, magnificent beast!<br/> <br/>Great monochrome too.</td>', 'Magnificent feet, magnificent flair, magnificent beast! Great monochrome too.', '2017-01-24 11:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494303, 1193414, 100393, '<td valign="top">The one eye, the too-close composition, the imperfect skin. A marvel of photographic choices.</td>', 'The one eye, the too-close composition, the imperfect skin. A marvel of photographic choices.', '2017-01-24 11:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494304, 1193320, 100393, '<td valign="top">Love this, great distortion, great color, intriguing museum scene.</td>', 'Love this, great distortion, great color, intriguing museum scene.', '2017-01-24 11:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494305, 1193441, 100393, '<td valign="top">I want to like this more than I do. I love the pristine focus on the eye and the muted highlights but I would like to see the shadows taken down a touch. Also, I find the texture invasive on her face.<br/> <br/>But, I gave it an 8 so I liked it quite a bit.</td>', 'I want to like this more than I do. I love the pristine focus on the eye and the muted highlights but I would like to see the shadows taken down a touch. Also, I find the texture invasive on her face. But, I gave it an 8 so I liked it quite a bit.', '2017-01-24 11:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494306, 1193688, 100393, '<td valign="top">Cool, great composition, timing and coloration.<br/> <br/>You know what you are doing.</td>', 'Cool, great composition, timing and coloration. You know what you are doing.', '2017-01-24 11:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494307, 1193772, 100393, '<td valign="top">What a doggy delight. Dark and amusing in equal measure. I can''t take it seriously though - the dramatic leaf, the dominant silhouette - makes me want to laugh out loud. I hope that was the intent. An 8 nonetheless.</td>', 'What a doggy delight. Dark and amusing in equal measure. I can''t take it seriously though - the dramatic leaf, the dominant silhouette - makes me want to laugh out loud. I hope that was the intent. An 8 nonetheless.', '2017-01-24 11:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494308, 1193124, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great use of noise; lovely low contrast; intriguing chair. I like it. 8</td>', 'Great use of noise; lovely low contrast; intriguing chair. I like it. 8', '2017-01-24 11:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494309, 1193080, 81362, '<td valign="top">Peaceful, calming, good simplicity. To my eye, the image could convey a  stronger message about the sea if presented as a panorama with much of the sky above the clouds eliminated, although that is just a matter of individual taste.</td>', 'Peaceful, calming, good simplicity. To my eye, the image could convey a  stronger message about the sea if presented as a panorama with much of the sky above the clouds eliminated, although that is just a matter of individual taste.', '2017-01-24 11:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494311, 1193733, 100393, '<td valign="top">Genius composition, lovely muted colors, great use of texture. 8.</td>', 'Genius composition, lovely muted colors, great use of texture. 8.', '2017-01-24 11:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494312, 1193038, 100393, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant and effective. You''ve judged loads of things really well here. 8.</td>', 'Simple, elegant and effective. You''ve judged loads of things really well here. 8.', '2017-01-24 11:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494313, 1193157, 81362, '<td valign="top">Stark bones and strong shadows contribute to a dramatic and artistic image.</td>', 'Stark bones and strong shadows contribute to a dramatic and artistic image.', '2017-01-24 11:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494314, 1193393, 100393, '<td valign="top">Just enough. [Like my comment]. 8.</td>', 'Just enough. [Like my comment]. 8.', '2017-01-24 11:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494315, 1193214, 100393, '<td valign="top">Juxtaposition of textures is slightly creepy but I really like the overall effect and mood. 8.</td>', 'Juxtaposition of textures is slightly creepy but I really like the overall effect and mood. 8.', '2017-01-24 11:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494316, 1192991, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Fantastically well judged - you''ve picked something that will fly with the impressionists and the literalists. Clever and well-executed. 8.</td>', 'Very well done. Fantastically well judged - you''ve picked something that will fly with the impressionists and the literalists. Clever and well-executed. 8.', '2017-01-24 11:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494317, 1193467, 81362, '<td valign="top">Somber and unusual, the image raises questions without answers. Seems like something we would find published on 1X, which often favors unique artistic concepts.</td>', 'Somber and unusual, the image raises questions without answers. Seems like something we would find published on 1X, which often favors unique artistic concepts.', '2017-01-24 11:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494318, 1193630, 100393, '<td valign="top">Like a jazz band on a pilgrimage. Effective and more than the sum of its parts. 8.</td>', 'Like a jazz band on a pilgrimage. Effective and more than the sum of its parts. 8.', '2017-01-24 11:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494319, 1193120, 100393, '<td valign="top">Invert the image and we have a ''J''. This is so you!<br/> <br/>Fantastic colours.<br/> <br/>[It was an 8 from me.]</td>', 'Invert the image and we have a ''J''. This is so you! Fantastic colours. [It was an 8 from me.]', '2017-01-24 11:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494320, 1192983, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, elegant photograph.  Not art (by which I mean only not my kind of art, but pretty much by definition it must be your kind of art).  The photograph appears casually composed, but it isn''t; it''s near to perfectly ordered, structured and balanced.  It''s a fabulously professional-looking photograph.  It could certainly be the feature image of an essay or magazine feature about Dubai or UAE. Really superb work, Thank you.</td>', 'Beautiful, elegant photograph.  Not art (by which I mean only not my kind of art, but pretty much by definition it must be your kind of art).  The photograph appears casually composed, but it isn''t; it''s near to perfectly ordered, structured and balanced.  It''s a fabulously professional-looking photograph.  It could certainly be the feature image of an essay or magazine feature about Dubai or UAE. Really superb work, Thank you.', '2017-01-24 11:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494321, 1193057, 100393, '<td valign="top">Good vision, well realized. Excellent outcome. 8.</td>', 'Good vision, well realized. Excellent outcome. 8.', '2017-01-24 11:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494322, 1193687, 81362, '<td valign="top">Well detailed, with the excellent decision to avoid including other colors, this image combines documentary and decorative purposes into a fine piece of artwork.</td>', 'Well detailed, with the excellent decision to avoid including other colors, this image combines documentary and decorative purposes into a fine piece of artwork.', '2017-01-24 11:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494323, 1193493, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good positioning to have the colorful background work so well as an apparent natural habitat for the colorful bicyclist to blend in so well. The combination results in quite a graphic work.</td>', 'Good positioning to have the colorful background work so well as an apparent natural habitat for the colorful bicyclist to blend in so well. The combination results in quite a graphic work.', '2017-01-24 12:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494324, 1193080, 182284, '<td valign="top">So many to choose from and this is my favorite so far. If it were mine I would have cropped some of the photo. It would really be eyecatching with the two Sailboats, the clouds hanging over them and the sky above the clouds just cropped a little closer. Nice shot. 9</td>', 'So many to choose from and this is my favorite so far. If it were mine I would have cropped some of the photo. It would really be eyecatching with the two Sailboats, the clouds hanging over them and the sky above the clouds just cropped a little closer. Nice shot. 9', '2017-01-24 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494325, 1193640, 30364, '<td valign="top">Simple but beautifully described by its title.  It is, at least for me, this ability to couple a thought with an image that is one of the most reliable indicators of art.  The thought might be expressed in a title, as here, or in some less explicit way.  But it''s the combination of the two that shares the artist''s inspiration.  Your thought here is so deceptively obvious, but quite perfect: perfectly illustrated in one direction, perfectly described in the other.  A lesson in economy and clarity.  Thank you.</td>', 'Simple but beautifully described by its title.  It is, at least for me, this ability to couple a thought with an image that is one of the most reliable indicators of art.  The thought might be expressed in a title, as here, or in some less explicit way.  But it''s the combination of the two that shares the artist''s inspiration.  Your thought here is so deceptively obvious, but quite perfect: perfectly illustrated in one direction, perfectly described in the other.  A lesson in economy and clarity.  Thank you.', '2017-01-24 12:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494327, 1193779, 182284, '<td valign="top">I do like this one. It looks most likely to be minimumly edited. Nice. 8</td>', 'I do like this one. It looks most likely to be minimumly edited. Nice. 8', '2017-01-24 12:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
