(7494339, 1193124, 156466, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, I love the treatment, but there''s something about the chair that feels wrong. I don''t know if it''s the type of chair (though I love the idea of a simple kitchen chair dragged out here), but its orientation in the frame just seems off. Needs to be rotated either square to the camera, looking in, or looking away. Looking out off the frame not so much. Might have made my top 5 otherwise.<br/> <br/>(update)<br/>Technically in my top 5 with ties, so I didn''t whack you very hard for the chair. :)</td>', 'I love the idea, I love the treatment, but there''s something about the chair that feels wrong. I don''t know if it''s the type of chair (though I love the idea of a simple kitchen chair dragged out here), but its orientation in the frame just seems off. Needs to be rotated either square to the camera, looking in, or looking away. Looking out off the frame not so much. Might have made my top 5 otherwise. (update)Technically in my top 5 with ties, so I didn''t whack you very hard for the chair. :)', '2017-01-24 12:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
