(7494578, 1193688, 24744, '<td valign="top">Going for the Ray Metzker look here?  Nice tones and overall composition, and of course lighting; however I find the complexity of the background a little distracting, with details such as the parking sign and yellow bollards and lights inside the window on the left each drawing attention from the core composition.</td>', 'Going for the Ray Metzker look here?  Nice tones and overall composition, and of course lighting; however I find the complexity of the background a little distracting, with details such as the parking sign and yellow bollards and lights inside the window on the left each drawing attention from the core composition.', '2017-01-24 21:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494580, 1193732, 94815, '<td valign="top">The simple difference between this and other decent landscapes is the lack of scale. As simple a truth as it is, this inclusion of a human strategically placed in the scene elevates the impact. Natural atmospheric perspective contributes as well to the success of the image. Very well done.</td>', 'The simple difference between this and other decent landscapes is the lack of scale. As simple a truth as it is, this inclusion of a human strategically placed in the scene elevates the impact. Natural atmospheric perspective contributes as well to the success of the image. Very well done.', '2017-01-24 21:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494581, 1193710, 24744, '<td valign="top">Excellent, flawless bold composition and crop.  Very daring.  I just find myself wishing there was something other than washed out white in the sky.  Still, one of my top picks for this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent, flawless bold composition and crop.  Very daring.  I just find myself wishing there was something other than washed out white in the sky.  Still, one of my top picks for this challenge.', '2017-01-24 21:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7494582, 1193188, 50641, '<td valign="top">My delusion doesn''t need have to have a moon in the sky<br/>My delusion doesn''t need a blue lagoon standing by<br/>No month of May, no twinkling stars<br/>No hideaway, no soft guitars<br/> <br/>My delusion doesn''t need a castle rising in Spain<br/>Or a dance to a constantly surprising refrain<br/>Wide awake, I can make my most fantastic dreams come true<br/> <br/>My delusion doesn''t need a thing but you<br/>and maybe some wet stairs and an umbrella.</td>', 'My delusion doesn''t need have to have a moon in the skyMy delusion doesn''t need a blue lagoon standing byNo month of May, no twinkling starsNo hideaway, no soft guitars My delusion doesn''t need a castle rising in SpainOr a dance to a constantly surprising refrainWide awake, I can make my most fantastic dreams come true My delusion doesn''t need a thing but youand maybe some wet stairs and an umbrella.', '2017-01-24 21:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
