(7494793, 1193057, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hyperfocal:</b></div><hr/><i> Too bad my internet connection has been out &amp; I didn''t get to finish scoring the whole challenge or I would have given it a 9. Beautiful, the only way I think it could have been improved would have been a bit of tone in a couple of blown out sections of the sky. Well Done! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>too bad, your vote would''ve brought me to the 5th place! ...but I forgive you :). Thank you for the comment! Yeah, the sky was too bright compared to almost black ground, I could try HDR it, but I am not a big fan of the HDR look, so I usually stay away from it. Blown out regions do not bother me here too much</td>', 'Originally posted by hyperfocal: Too bad my internet connection has been out & I didn''t get to finish scoring the whole challenge or I would have given it a 9. Beautiful, the only way I think it could have been improved would have been a bit of tone in a couple of blown out sections of the sky. Well Done!  too bad, your vote would''ve brought me to the 5th place! ...but I forgive you :). Thank you for the comment! Yeah, the sky was too bright compared to almost black ground, I could try HDR it, but I am not a big fan of the HDR look, so I usually stay away from it. Blown out regions do not bother me here too much', '2017-01-25 13:07:38.000000', NULL, 0),
