(7494852, 1193188, 109387, '<td valign="top">First of all, congrats on the ribbon... not easy in a challenge like that.<br/> <br/>I have mixed feelings about this image: I think it deserved a top 3/5/10 and I like it. At the same time if I look at the original I can see a ''far from perfect'' image. Editing is maybe not too strong but it completely change the perception of the photo. And it makes me wonder which is the meaning of Art?. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=172697" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">waitingsilence</a> and I were taking a look at the first 30 images of this challenge and we often disagreed about which were the best ones. Well, I''m sorry if I used your image to talk about the challenge in general, so I stop here. Congrats on the ribbon, I truly think you deserved it :)</td>', 'First of all, congrats on the ribbon... not easy in a challenge like that. I have mixed feelings about this image: I think it deserved a top 3/5/10 and I like it. At the same time if I look at the original I can see a ''far from perfect'' image. Editing is maybe not too strong but it completely change the perception of the photo. And it makes me wonder which is the meaning of Art?.  waitingsilence and I were taking a look at the first 30 images of this challenge and we often disagreed about which were the best ones. Well, I''m sorry if I used your image to talk about the challenge in general, so I stop here. Congrats on the ribbon, I truly think you deserved it :)', '2017-01-25 19:19:29.000000', NULL, 0),
